23:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Tests, transcripts and references are separate tasks",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Tests, transcripts and references are separate tasks"}],[["$","p","The reviewed call requires GRE General, with a stated minimum of 145 in each of the two scored sections and a stronger relevant-section score. Its package includes three references, a GRE report and transcripts with the grading-scale explanation. Selected candidates take TOEFL. The call allows issuing-authority-attested degree/transcript evidence at application, while preferring HEC attestation. Read the complete eligibility and exclusion list, including nationality/residence conditions, directly on USEFP.",{"children":"The reviewed call requires GRE General, with a stated minimum of 145 in each of the two scored sections and a stronger relevant-section score. Its package includes three references, a GRE report and transcripts with the grading-scale explanation. Selected candidates take TOEFL. The call allows issuing-authority-attested degree/transcript evidence at application, while preferring HEC attestation. Read the complete eligibility and exclusion list, including nationality/residence conditions, directly on USEFP."}],["$","p","Create a private submission folder with separate files for academic history, tests, referees and essay evidence. Label files by document and version rather than using names such as final-final. Record whether a requirement is ready, requested or blocked. This is an organisation method, not a substitute for the next application’s upload instructions.",{"children":"Create a private submission folder with separate files for academic history, tests, referees and essay evidence. Label files by document and version rather than using names such as final-final. Record whether a requirement is ready, requested or blocked. This is an organisation method, not a substitute for the next application’s upload instructions."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://usefp.org/scholarships/fulbright-degree.cfm",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://usefp.org/scholarships/fulbright-degree.cfm","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"USEFP current requirements"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Build an evidence argument before writing",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build an evidence argument before writing"}],[["$","p","Start with a concrete academic or public problem you want to understand. Identify an experience that made the problem visible, what you did, the limitation you encountered and the training you need. A statement that merely praises the United States or asks for funding does not establish that connection.",{"children":"Start with a concrete academic or public problem you want to understand. Identify an experience that made the problem visible, what you did, the limitation you encountered and the training you need. A statement that merely praises the United States or asks for funding does not establish that connection."}],["$","p","A useful planning row contains: problem, your action, observable result, lesson, proposed study and intended contribution. If you cannot support a result, describe the work honestly without invented numbers. Where a goal depends on an institution or employer, explain the first feasible step rather than promising a national transformation.",{"children":"A useful planning row contains: problem, your action, observable result, lesson, proposed study and intended contribution. If you cannot support a result, describe the work honestly without invented numbers. Where a goal depends on an institution or employer, explain the first feasible step rather than promising a national transformation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$L26","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L27"]}],"$L28","$L29"]}]
